# ============================================================
# Global .dockerignore for His.Hope monorepo
# ============================================================

# --- .NET build artifacts ---
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/packages/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
*.user
*.suo
*.cache
*.vspscc

# --- Node.js / Angular ---
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.angular/
**/coverage/

# --- Git ---
**/.git/
**/.gitignore
**/.gitattributes

# --- IDE & Editor ---
**/.idea/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Documentation (large files) ---
**/*.md
!README.md
!shared/frontend-foundation/README.md
!shared/frontend-foundation/CHANGELOG.md
!shared/frontend-foundation/COMPATIBILITY.md
!shared/frontend-foundation/LICENSE
!shared/frontend-foundation/docs/**

# --- Test & Coverage ---
**/TestResults/
**/coverlet/
**/coverage/
*.trx
*.testlog

# --- Docker & Kubernetes ---
**/docker-compose.override.yml
**/.env
!.env.example
**/.env.*
!**/*.env.example

# Provider credentials must be mounted as runtime secrets, never copied into images.
**/account.json
**/*firebase*credentials*.json

# --- Logs ---
**/*.log
**/logs/
**/Logs/
!dashboard-app/src/app/features/logs/
!dashboard-app/src/app/features/logs/**

# --- Temp files ---
**/tmp/
**/temp/
**/.tmp/

# --- CI/CD pipeline artifacts ---
**/.tekton/
**/pipeline-runs/

# --- Local runtime, diagnostics and generated evidence ---
# The .NET Dockerfiles build from the monorepo root, so keep generated local
# state out of every service build context. These files are never required by
# restore/publish and can otherwise add gigabytes to Docker's upload step.
**/.runtime/
**/.worktrees/
**/artifacts/
**/audit-artifact/
**/backend-diag*/
**/backend-diagnostics/
**/ci-*/
**/coverage-*/
**/diag-*/
**/*-log-extracted/
**/test-results/
**/StrykerOutput/
**/trivy-archive/
**/tmpcov/
**/.playwright-mcp/
**/.npm-cache-foundation/

# Service Dockerfiles only need the .NET source tree and repository build
# metadata. Tests, documentation, frontends and local tooling are never read
# by `dotnet restore/publish` and must not be uploaded as build context.
tests/
docs/
admin-app/
operator-mobile/
manufacturing-buyer-app/
mobile-app/
dashboard-app/
customer-portal-app/
internal-operator-app/
feature-tree/
.tmp/
.tools/

# --- Python (ML services) ---
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.venv/
**/.pytest_cache/

# --- Bazel ---
**/bazel-*/
**/.bazelrc.user

# --- Archives ---
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.7z
